==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# Loose [[rein]](s), as of a [[horse]].
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1884|author=Elizabeth Platt Karr|page=256|title=The American Horsewoman
|passage=she should simply hold the reins so lightly that his mouth can just be felt, which is called "giving a '''free rein'''."}}
#* '''1910''', Virgil (translated into English by Theodore C. Williams), page 8,
#*: So ceased the sea's uproar, when its grave Sire<br>Looked o'er th' expanse, and, riding on in light,<br>Flung '''free rein''' to his winged obedient car.
# {{lb|en|figurative}} The [[absence]] of [[constraint]]s; [[freedom]] to make [[decision]]s.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1790|author=Thomas Pennant|title=Of London|page=47
|passage=Chaucer gave a '''free rein''' to his poetical mirth}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=Aug 6 1861|journal=New York Times|title=SLAVERY AND THE WAR.,SPEECH OF WENDELL PHILLIPS, ESQ., AT THE CELEBRATION OF WEST INDIES EMANCIPATION
|passage=Help the Government to dare to give '''free rein''' to the ardor of the people.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1913|author=Charles George Herbermann; Edward Aloysius Pace; Condé Bénoist Pallen; Thomas Joseph Shahan; John Joseph Wynne|title=The Catholic Encyclopedia: An International Work of Reference on the Constitution, Doctrine, Discipline, and History of the Catholic Church|page=647
|passage=securing for himself an undivided authority and a '''free rein''' for his profligacy.}}
#* {{quote-journal|1=en|year=2018|author=James Lambert|title=Setting the Record Straight: An In-depth Examination of ''Hobson-Jobson''|journal=International Journal of Lexicography|volume=31|issue=4|doi=https://doi.org/10.1093/ijl/ecy010|page=487|text=Such hedging is necessitated by the lack of in-depth knowledge of the contents, which also gives '''free rein''' to the scripting of unsubstantiated factoids concerning the book.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2021-07-21|author=Phil Gates|title=Country diary: this forgotten grassland is a butterfly Serengeti|journal=w:The Guardian|url=https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2021/jul/21/country-diary-this-forgotten-grassland-is-a-butterfly-serengeti|passage=If I give my imagination '''free rein''' on this sultry afternoon, I could almost believe this shoulder-high grassland – a shimmering sea of false oat, cock’s-foot and meadow foxtail – is African savanna.}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=A. A. Dowd|title=The {{w|Ryan Reynolds}} action-comedy ''{{w|Free Guy}}'' is a ''{{w|Truman Show}}'' for the ''{{w|Fortnite}}'' age|url=https://www.avclub.com/the-ryan-reynolds-action-comedy-free-guy-is-a-truman-sh-1847429238|work=w:The A.V. Club|date=6 August 2021|passage=Free City is, by design, a generic multiplayer sandbox—it’s supposed to look like any and every '''free-rein''' video game metropolis.}}

